# 🗂️ Task Management System (C++)

A **console-based Task Management System** built in **C++**, designed to help users manage **projects, users, and tasks** efficiently through file persistence (`database.txt`).

This system allows users to create, update, delete, and view tasks — along with user registration and project association — all stored and managed through structured file operations.

---

## 🚀 Features

✅ Add, edit, and delete tasks  
✅ Assign tasks to users and projects  
✅ Categorize and label tasks  
✅ Track task completion status (Finished / Unfinished)  
✅ Generate full system reports (tasks, users, projects)  
✅ Register new users and validate IDs  
✅ Persistent storage via `database.txt`  
✅ Console-based interactive UI  

