## 🧠 System Overview

### 🧍‍♂️ User
Represents a system user with:
- `name`, `userID`, and `role`
- Can be assigned to multiple projects and tasks

### 🏗️ Project
Represents a project with:
- `name` and `description`
- Holds associated `Task` and `User` references

### ✅ Task
Represents a single task with:
- `name`, `description`, `category`, `label`, `status`, and `time`
- Pointers to the assigned `User` and `Project`

### 💾 FileHandler
Handles all file input/output operations:
- Writes tasks into file (`writeTasksIntoFile`)
- Reads and reconstructs objects from file (`readTasksFromFile`)
- Updates and deletes tasks in `database.txt`
- Generates reports and manages user creation

### 🖥️ TaskManagementUI
Provides the interactive CLI interface with options to:
- Add / Delete / Update tasks
- Register users
- Generate reports
- Search for tasks by project

